      "id": "teach_8_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Set the two expressions equal:\n12v − 36 = 15v − 75\n3v = 39 → v = 13 m/s.\nThen L = 12 × 10 = 120 m.\n\nSame train means the hidden L is the bridge between the two clues.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_8"
        }
      ]
